{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:41:33+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NewMe NuMe LuMe: Alien Wars", "steam_appid": 2855660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/6cb7655d7aafb2fcbc8f8fadedba308b.avif?t=1792730633\" width=256 height=256 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/f3252c27cfd8093d25ecf157e7c07682.avif?t=1792730633\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>1. Story of the Game</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kim Ttolttol, a young girl in her twenties and currently a college student, spends her days lazing around at home due to the recent college break. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she crosses the street like any other day, she suddenly finds herself in a blank space amidst the sound of a truck horn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In front of the bewildered Kim Ttolttol, two gods appear, offering to send her home if she helps them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>2. Gameplay</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/161f1be8239b548fd62da8dc5c5e9471.avif?t=1792730633\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NewMe NuMe LuMe: Alien Wars is a 2D top-down action game where stages are cleared using movement, sliding, shooting, and melee attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages are structured with at least one boss and mid-boss, currently consisting of six stages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/30014addac50bcd164aae467a3b46f69.avif?t=1792730633\" width=512 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/7867e1e2eabfdd46bc14fe68dc089cff.poster.avif?t=1792730633\" width=320 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/7867e1e2eabfdd46bc14fe68dc089cff.webm?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/7867e1e2eabfdd46bc14fe68dc089cff.mp4?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 11 weapon items in the stages to aid Kim Ttolttol's battles, which can be acquired and used to defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/682f42a2f4219a9a4a6e90f0b4ee2b45.avif?t=1792730633\" width=512 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance health, movement speed, shooting, and melee attacks with money dropped when defeating enemies after clearing each stage, making subsequent gameplay smoother. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+) About the Additional Stages</u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/49c1b385aeff965fcd662384c0e93943.avif?t=1792730633\" width=512 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate from the main game, I am currently working on a total of four additional stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/ca92e7b8f13c3a32ec0fcc3659c260a5.poster.avif?t=1792730633\" width=540 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/ca92e7b8f13c3a32ec0fcc3659c260a5.webm?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/ca92e7b8f13c3a32ec0fcc3659c260a5.mp4?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike the original top-view style, these additional stages are being made as a side-scrolling shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, Stage 1 through Stage 2 have been temporarily updated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/a9ca2fd28e2d7d3343319c307b3b1d5a.poster.avif?t=1792730633\" width=540 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/a9ca2fd28e2d7d3343319c307b3b1d5a.webm?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/a9ca2fd28e2d7d3343319c307b3b1d5a.mp4?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, these additional stages are not made with the original pixel art style,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but with drawings I made myself on a tablet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/708e1a89ba27d326ee0b6ec5128a95ba.avif?t=1792730633\" width=470 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I post a development log once a month through announcements and news,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so if you are interested in the development process, please check those posts!<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/e2340fbc4324ae7d2336412024b8101c.poster.avif?t=1792730633\" width=600 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/e2340fbc4324ae7d2336412024b8101c.webm?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/6cb7655d7aafb2fcbc8f8fadedba308b.avif?t=1792730633\" width=256 height=256 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/f3252c27cfd8093d25ecf157e7c07682.avif?t=1792730633\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>1. Story of the Game</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kim Ttolttol, a young girl in her twenties and currently a college student, spends her days lazing around at home due to the recent college break. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she crosses the street like any other day, she suddenly finds herself in a blank space amidst the sound of a truck horn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In front of the bewildered Kim Ttolttol, two gods appear, offering to send her home if she helps them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>2. Gameplay</u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                               