 defeating enemies after clearing each stage, making subsequent gameplay smoother. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+) About the Additional Stages</u>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/49c1b385aeff965fcd662384c0e93943.avif?t=1792730633\" width=512 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate from the main game, I am currently working on a total of four additional stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/ca92e7b8f13c3a32ec0fcc3659c260a5.poster.avif?t=1792730633\" width=540 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/ca92e7b8f13c3a32ec0fcc3659c260a5.webm?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/ca92e7b8f13c3a32ec0fcc3659c260a5.mp4?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike the original top-view style, these additional stages are being made as a side-scrolling shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, Stage 1 through Stage 2 have been temporarily updated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/a9ca2fd28e2d7d3343319c307b3b1d5a.poster.avif?t=1792730633\" width=540 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855660/extras/a9ca2fd28e2d7d3343319c307b3b1d5a.webm?t=1792730633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=